<title>DUBAI: UAE cen bank foreign reserves dip in September.</title>
<headline>UAE cen bank foreign reserves dip in September.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-10-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United Arab Emirates foreign currency reserves dipped in September to 27.7 billion dirhams from August's 30.2 billion, Central Bank figures show.</p>
<p>(Millions of dirhams, rounded)</p>
<p>			     Sept 96	   Aug 96</p>
<p> Assets: Gold		  700		700</p>
<p> Foreign		    27,700	   30,200</p>
<p> Other assets		  700		400</p>
<p> Total assets	     29,100	   31,300</p>
<p> Liabilities: CDs	  6,300	    6,200</p>
<p> Other liabilities	 1,200	    3,800</p>
<p>-- Dubai newsroom +9714 6071-222</p>
</text>
